devon_customer: Appreciate it. One more Q: any guidance on detection vs normalization? We prefer to fail loudly if the model is off-spec rather than mask it silently.

maria_support: Good policy. We will implement the shim to run in a 'warn-only' mode by default: logs + header X-Compat-Transform: true. You can flip to 'auto-correct' after you confirm volume is safe.

devon_customer: Perfect. Please send the patch and I'll run it on staging.

